From: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] Treat diagnostic errors as a literal string

The joined diagnostics contain no formatting arguments. Use errors.New so
percent signs are preserved and current Go vet accepts the call.

Signed-off-by: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
--- a/v8/client/client.go
+++ b/v8/client/client.go
@@ -303,7 +303,7 @@
 	if errs == nil || len(errs) < 1 {
 		return nil
 	}
-	err = fmt.Errorf(strings.Join(errs, "\n"))
+	err = errors.New(strings.Join(errs, "\n"))
 	return err
 }
 
